      "source": "https://www.cabotar.gov/465/Cabots-History-and-the-Future",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Cabot Creamery Cooperative, founded in 1919, helped make the town a dairy‑farming hub that still thrives today.",
